# Gateway MACs of networks where the HUD may run its ping sweep, one per line.
# Anything after the MAC is a free-form note.
#
# Only list networks you own or are authorised to scan. Without this file the
# HUD stays fully passive.
#
# Copy to ~/.config/sentinel-hud/sweep-networks and edit. Find your
# gateway's MAC with:
#   ip neigh show "$(ip route show default | awk '{print $3; exit}')"
#
# aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff  home router
